Licence of the original material in this repository
===================================================

Everything written for this repository (the research documents under docs/, scripts/, the
original tweaks under tweaks/, CREDITS.md and README.md) is licensed under the MIT licence below.

Exceptions, which keep their own licences (see CREDITS.md for who wrote what):
  * tweaks/lighting/stick-led-color.py and tweaks/battery/thor-charge-limit
    come from Armada forks and stay GPL-2.0-or-later (Armada's LICENSE.md: original Armada
    scripts are GPL-2.0-or-later). Terms: LICENSES/GPL-2.0.txt (the terms only, without the
    FSF "how to apply" appendix).
  * tweaks/audio/50-thor-speaker-eq.conf is adapted from a preset whose repository declares
    no licence; it is included with credit and will be removed or changed on request.
  * plugins/thor-input has its own LICENSE (MIT).
  * Nothing under refs/ is part of this repository (it is git-ignored); those projects keep
    their own licences.

